                         Contacts
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Syntax: contacts

Consult the local criminal network for a compact report on your current
incident, city-guard warnings, active guard pass, local corruption, and
expected bribe price.

Contacts no longer tracks or reveals other players. Corrupt city guards
still own the normal 'bribe guard' interaction. Silver Tongue and the
Fence Method can reduce the price quoted by the guard network.

Cost: 20 spell points
